### Получить все цены
GET http://localhost:8080/api/supplier-prices

### Первая цена поставщика 3
POST http://localhost:8080/api/supplier-prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 3,
  "productId": 1,
  "price": 100.00,
  "dateFrom": "2026-08-01",
  "dateTo": null
}

### Новая цена поставщика 3
POST http://localhost:8080/api/supplier-prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 3,
  "productId": 1,
  "price": 120.00,
  "dateFrom": "2026-09-01",
  "dateTo": null
}

### Проверить историю цен
GET http://localhost:8080/api/supplier-prices

### Поставка 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "deliveryDate": "2026-08-30",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "weight": 10.5
    }
  ]
}

### Поставка 2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "deliveryDate": "2026-08-31",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "weight": 20.0
    },
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "weight": 5.0
    }
  ]
}

### Поставка 3
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 2,
  "deliveryDate": "2026-08-29",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "weight": 30.0
    }
  ]
}

### Отчёт за август
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/deliveries?dateFrom=2026-08-01&dateTo=2026-08-31

### Пустой период
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/deliveries?dateFrom=2025-01-01&dateTo=2025-01-31

### Обновить поставщика 3
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/suppliers/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Поставщик 3 обновленный"
}

### Обновить продукт 2
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Груша Конференция Premium",
  "type": "PEAR"
}

### Проверить поставщиков после обновления
GET http://localhost:8080/api/suppliers

### Проверить продукты после обновления
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### Пустое имя поставщика -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}

### Слишком короткое имя поставщика -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "А"
}

### Дубликат поставщика -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Поставщик 1"
}

### Пустое название продукта -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "type": "APPLE"
}

### Нет типа продукта -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Яблоко тестовое",
  "type": null
}

### Дубликат продукта -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Яблоко Голден",
  "type": "APPLE"
}

### Отрицательная цена -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/supplier-prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "price": -150.00,
  "dateFrom": "2026-10-01",
  "dateTo": null
}

### Нулевая цена -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/supplier-prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "price": 0,
  "dateFrom": "2026-10-01",
  "dateTo": null
}

### Нет supplierId -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/supplier-prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": null,
  "productId": 1,
  "price": 150.00,
  "dateFrom": "2026-10-01",
  "dateTo": null
}

### Несуществующий поставщик -> 404
POST http://localhost:8080/api/supplier-prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 9999,
  "productId": 1,
  "price": 150.00,
  "dateFrom": "2026-10-01",
  "dateTo": null
}

### Несуществующий товар -> 404
POST http://localhost:8080/api/supplier-prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "productId": 9999,
  "price": 150.00,
  "dateFrom": "2026-10-01",
  "dateTo": null
}

### dateTo раньше dateFrom -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/supplier-prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "price": 150.00,
  "dateFrom": "2026-09-01",
  "dateTo": "2026-08-01"
}

### Повторная цена с тем же dateFrom -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/supplier-prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 3,
  "productId": 1,
  "price": 130.00,
  "dateFrom": "2026-09-01",
  "dateTo": null
}

### Цена задним числом при наличии более поздней -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/supplier-prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 3,
  "productId": 1,
  "price": 110.00,
  "dateFrom": "2026-08-15",
  "dateTo": null
}

### Поставка без товаров -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "deliveryDate": "2026-08-30",
  "items": []
}

### Отрицательный вес -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "deliveryDate": "2026-08-30",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "weight": -10
    }
  ]
}

### Нулевой вес -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "deliveryDate": "2026-08-30",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "weight": 0
    }
  ]
}

### Нет productId -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "deliveryDate": "2026-08-30",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": null,
      "weight": 10
    }
  ]
}

### Несуществующий товар -> 404
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "deliveryDate": "2026-08-30",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 9999,
      "weight": 10
    }
  ]
}

### Неверный период -> 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/deliveries?dateFrom=2026-09-01&dateTo=2026-08-01

### Удаление поставщика с зависимостями -> 409
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/suppliers/1

### Удаление товара с зависимостями -> 409
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### Несуществующий поставщик -> 404
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/suppliers/9999

### Несуществующий товар -> 404
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/9999
